WEBVTT

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:15.400
Stop being stubborn.  Just admit defeat.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.500
It’s nothing to be ashamed about.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:20.480
Humans are no match for us.

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:25.080
If you obey, I’m willing 
to consider coexistence.

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:27.820
Compromise is sometimes necessary.

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:29.550
Coexistence?

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:35.870
Though I say "coexistence," you'll 
actually be under our control.

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:41.090
If you obey, I’m willing to leave 
you in a corner of the world.

00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:44.110
How compassionate of you.

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:49.950
If we don’t view you as the enemy, you 
won’t oppress us more than necessary?

00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:51.070
That’s right.

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:57.320
If humans don’t openly view us as the 
enemy, we can live together in peace.

00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:59.410
That’s not peace!

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:02.880
It’s more peaceful than extinction.

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:08.890
You readily admit your crimes, but 
you shamelessly talk of peace.

00:01:08.890 --> 00:01:10.620
That’s why you’re an Ignis.

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:12.840
What do you mean?

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:17.070
I already know you have no 
desire to coexist with humans.

00:01:18.030 --> 00:01:21.960
When I consider what you did to your partner!

00:01:38.290 --> 00:01:44.300
Our lives aren't forever

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:51.090
We wander, searching for the meaning of life

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:58.410
Even if it's not the right direction, 
just keep looking forward

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:04.990
Sharing hope for the future

00:02:04.990 --> 00:02:11.730
tell me  We're searching for 
memories lost in the darkness

00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:18.960
I feel your flame  Your 
impulses pierce the light

00:02:19.100 --> 00:02:25.670
I want to share your pain

00:02:54.490 --> 00:02:55.490
Partner?

00:02:55.850 --> 00:02:58.690
What did I do to who?

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:01.140
That’s right, Windy!

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:03.300
You have a partner too!

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:07.170
Partner?  Of course I did.

00:03:07.610 --> 00:03:08.560
"Did?"

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:14.420
Windy, did you do something to your partner?

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:18.020
Did you steal his consciousness, 
like Kusanagi’s brother?

00:03:18.020 --> 00:03:20.120
It’s worse than that.

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:21.080
What?

00:03:21.460 --> 00:03:26.830
We uncovered every person 
related to the Lost Incident.

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:28.290
And we learned...

00:03:28.290 --> 00:03:34.200
That an AI caused one victim to be 
involved in a reckless driving accident!

00:03:43.230 --> 00:03:44.700
So you investigated that.

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:47.450
That was your partner?

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:50.610
An AI caused an accident?

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:52.670
What for?

00:03:53.610 --> 00:03:55.820
To put it simply…

00:03:55.820 --> 00:03:57.420
I didn’t need him.

00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:59.250
Didn’t need him?

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:08.460
It’s annoying to have a 
partner always by your side.

00:04:08.460 --> 00:04:10.830
I don't know what you mean!

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:13.200
He was your partner!

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:14.300
What you did was-

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:15.490
Exactly!

00:04:16.430 --> 00:04:21.310
If you’re always with a partner, you 
become devoted to humans - like you.

00:04:21.310 --> 00:04:23.250
Devoted?

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:25.310
I don’t like that!

00:04:25.310 --> 00:04:28.280
That's what I feel when I look at you, Ai.

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:30.270
No way…

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:32.770
Don’t need humans…

00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:36.020
Lightning!  Did you know this?

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:39.260
He made that decision on his own.

00:04:39.260 --> 00:04:42.640
His own decision?

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:45.160
Get it, Playmaker?

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:47.660
This is the true nature of the Ignis.

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:51.600
How will you find a way to coexist with them?

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:58.000
This all started because 
Kogami tried to erase us.

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:01.150
But I’ll erase you instead.

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:04.530
Sorry, but I'm not sticking with your plan.

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:08.040
You’re one to talk - 
you barely have any LP.

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:10.370
The battle isn’t over yet!

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:11.130
What?

00:05:11.130 --> 00:05:15.840
I Special Summon Speedburst 
Dragon from my hand!

00:05:17.610 --> 00:05:23.620
When I take effect damage, 
I can Special Summon it!

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:31.130
And you take damage equal to the 
damage I took, and I regain half!

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:34.680
Revolver took 3000 damage!

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:46.410
He got you this time.

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:49.370
How dare you!

00:05:49.730 --> 00:05:50.860
It’s not over!

00:05:50.860 --> 00:05:55.100
Speedburst Dragon attacks Rockbuster!

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:01.440
He turned this duel around.

00:06:03.740 --> 00:06:05.880
How dare you!

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:09.220
An AI who would hurt his partner…

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:13.120
My father regrets creating you!

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:14.750
You’re wrong!

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:21.700
Kogami’s proudest achievement was to 
create excellent successors like us!

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:23.200
Stop joking!

00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:28.070
By inheriting my father’s regrets 
and desires, I'll defeat you!

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:32.540
Inherit?  That’s impossible!

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:36.400
Kogami didn’t believe in you.

00:06:36.400 --> 00:06:40.600
Why weren’t you chosen as a test subject?

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:43.920
He thought you wouldn't work.

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:46.120
He expected nothing from you!

00:06:46.120 --> 00:06:49.350
And you’re the one who’ll 
kill us?  Don’t make me laugh!

00:06:50.060 --> 00:06:55.840
Believe me, I never wanted 
to involve you in this.

00:06:56.580 --> 00:07:00.240
Protect humanity's future in my place.

00:07:00.240 --> 00:07:03.450
You're my final and only hope.

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:13.620
Deep down, you want to crush us because 
you're angry that Kogami didn't choose you.

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:19.480
AIs have lame imagination.

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:20.720
What?

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:26.460
You'll never understand the 
bond between me and my father.

00:07:26.680 --> 00:07:28.430
So annoying.

00:07:28.770 --> 00:07:30.670
I end my turn.

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:33.470
I don’t care to understand.

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:35.630
Because I'm erasing you.

00:07:35.630 --> 00:07:37.960
My turn!  I draw!

00:07:37.960 --> 00:07:41.770
I activate the spell card, Stormrider Return!

00:07:42.420 --> 00:07:45.510
When there are no cards 
in my Spell & Trap Zone...

00:07:45.510 --> 00:07:49.480
...I Special Summon a 
Stormrider from my graveyard!

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:52.260
Come, Rockbuster!

00:07:52.260 --> 00:07:55.720
Then Stormrider Turbulence’s effect!

00:07:55.720 --> 00:08:01.640
But Borreload and Speedburst both 
have more ATK than Rockbuster!

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:08.320
This is where I get started!

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:11.260
The wind, come to my hand!

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:15.160
Data Storm?

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:23.780
I'm the Wind Ignis!

00:08:23.780 --> 00:08:27.420
No one can manipulate 
the wind better than me!

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:31.020
When I have 1000 or lower LP, I can add a

00:08:31.020 --> 00:08:35.450
random Link Monster in the 
Data Storm to my Extra Deck!

00:08:32.390 --> 00:08:35.440
Hey!  Can it be?

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:39.700
I activate my Skill!  Storm Access!

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:45.640
Storm Access during a Master Duel?

00:08:45.640 --> 00:08:49.240
I’ve seen this before.

00:08:49.240 --> 00:08:49.900
Yeah.

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:59.260
Can it be?  You teamed up with Bohman?

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:00.980
Took you long enough.

00:09:00.980 --> 00:09:05.130
So that’s why Bohman can use Storm Access!

00:09:05.130 --> 00:09:08.980
I’m the best at controlling the Data Storm!

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:12.560
He and you are just imitating me!

00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:14.220
That means…

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:17.800
Windy!  You know where 
Kusanagi’s brother is!

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:21.520
I'll tell you after I defeat him.

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:23.380
So behave 'til then.

00:09:23.610 --> 00:09:25.130
Windy…

00:09:25.730 --> 00:09:30.460
Appear!  The circuit that rages before me!

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:33.870
The summoning conditions are 
at least two Stormriders!

00:09:33.870 --> 00:09:40.170
I set Harpiarm and Link 2 
Rockbuster in the Link Markers!

00:09:40.170 --> 00:09:41.900
Link Summon!

00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:48.040
Appear, Link 3 Stormridership Bahamut Bomber!

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:56.350
It's the new monster he 
acquired using Storm Access!

00:09:56.350 --> 00:09:58.320
I’m only getting started!

00:09:58.780 --> 00:10:02.160
The Field Spell, Stormrider 
Turbulence's effect!

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:06.160
It now has more ATK than Borreload!

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:08.220
I’m still not done!

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:11.240
Bahamut Bomber’s effect activates!

00:10:11.240 --> 00:10:16.250
When I Special Summon it when there are 
no cards in my Spell & Trap Zone...

00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:20.860
...one of your cards is destroyed, 
and you take 500 damage!

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:24.140
Vanish, Borreload!

00:10:27.840 --> 00:10:29.190
Battle!

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:33.220
Bahamut Bomber attacks Speedburst Dragon!

00:10:43.060 --> 00:10:47.670
I activate Stormrider Skyfisher’s 
effect from my hand!

00:10:47.670 --> 00:10:52.770
When there are no cards in my Spell 
& Trap Zone or Main Monster Zone...

00:10:52.770 --> 00:10:56.000
...it Special Summons itself 
in defense position!

00:10:56.000 --> 00:11:00.920
Then you set a spell or trap 
card from your graveyard!

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:05.030
But the set card can’t be activated!

00:11:05.030 --> 00:11:07.440
So return a card from your graveyard!

00:11:07.440 --> 00:11:10.470
But it's useless and unusable!

00:11:11.820 --> 00:11:14.720
I set Magic Cylinder.

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:19.460
Well done!  But it’s 
not over yet, of course!

00:11:19.460 --> 00:11:25.460
Due to Bahamut Bomber’s effect, a card 
in your Spell & Trap Zone is destroyed!

00:11:25.460 --> 00:11:27.980
And you take 500 damage!

00:11:27.980 --> 00:11:31.650
Vanish, that useless Magic Cylinder!

00:11:34.150 --> 00:11:36.520
Skyfisher’s effect activates!

00:11:36.520 --> 00:11:40.650
When Turbulence is on the field, 
I return this card to my hand.

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:45.890
I end my turn.

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:48.890
Hey, Revolver is going to lose!

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:53.400
No.  As long as he has 
LP, he won’t give up.

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:54.610
Correct.

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:57.800
Knights of Hanoi!

00:11:58.520 --> 00:12:03.590
Hey!  Your leader only has 100 LP left!

00:12:03.590 --> 00:12:05.440
So what?

00:12:06.810 --> 00:12:09.420
It’s not 0.  So it’s plenty.

00:12:09.420 --> 00:12:11.370
There’s no way he’ll lose!

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:13.680
Revolver will win!

00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:16.220
What a bond!

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:19.290
It's time to perform your last rites.

00:12:19.830 --> 00:12:21.760
Go apologize to your dad!

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:26.540
Apologize?  How ridiculous.

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:28.850
Revolver…

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:31.440
Did you take care of the weaklings below?

00:12:31.440 --> 00:12:34.150
Yes.  We destroyed them all.

00:12:34.150 --> 00:12:35.370
What?

00:12:35.370 --> 00:12:37.390
Don’t worry.

00:12:37.390 --> 00:12:42.240
Those without DNA were surprisingly weak.

00:12:42.640 --> 00:12:45.410
How dare you!

00:12:46.300 --> 00:12:50.340
Then it’s about time I end this too.

00:12:58.670 --> 00:12:59.960
What’s this?

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:02.370
Where’s Ai and Playmaker?

00:13:02.370 --> 00:13:04.390
No one’s here.

00:13:04.390 --> 00:13:05.840
No, wait.

00:13:06.730 --> 00:13:08.210
That’s…

00:13:10.250 --> 00:13:11.730
He’s…

00:13:13.620 --> 00:13:16.210
You’re... Spectre!

00:13:16.210 --> 00:13:19.080
I was waiting for you, Soulburner.

00:13:19.410 --> 00:13:21.210
You know who I am?

00:13:21.210 --> 00:13:23.450
And everything you’ve done.

00:13:23.450 --> 00:13:26.320
That’s the Fire Ignis, right?

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:27.710
Are you going to-

00:13:27.710 --> 00:13:32.320
Whoa!  I don’t intend 
to fight you right now.

00:13:32.320 --> 00:13:36.660
I just finished clearing the 
garbage to make it easier to walk.

00:13:37.150 --> 00:13:40.040
Easier to walk…

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:43.040
I'll guide you up.

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:43.650
Guide?

00:13:43.650 --> 00:13:46.120
Be careful!  It may be a trap!

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:48.930
Please don't question me.

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:55.120
Soulburner, you need to see 
the truth about the Ignis.

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:57.070
Truth about the Ignis?

00:13:57.070 --> 00:13:58.220
What do you mean?

00:13:58.220 --> 00:14:04.050
After I show you, please decide whether you 
want to keep working with that Fire Ignis.

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:11.640
If that still doesn't change 
your views, I'll erase you.

00:14:19.090 --> 00:14:22.480
You no longer have your ace monster!

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:25.480
You're guaranteed to lose!

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:29.100
Why don’t you admit that you can’t win?

00:14:31.610 --> 00:14:33.830
You're funny.

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:37.990
The climax featuring Revolver’s 
victory is just starting.

00:14:39.240 --> 00:14:41.760
Windy and Revolver are dueling?

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:43.040
Soulburner?

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:43.740
Flame!

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:45.750
Playmaker?

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:47.610
Yusaku!  Ai!

00:14:48.800 --> 00:14:52.210
Four Ignis in the same room.

00:14:52.210 --> 00:14:54.680
Ai!  What’s going on?

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:58.260
Did the Knights of Hanoi do this?

00:14:58.260 --> 00:15:00.020
No no!

00:15:00.020 --> 00:15:04.220
Windy and Lightning are the one who did this!

00:15:04.220 --> 00:15:05.260
Lightning?

00:15:06.110 --> 00:15:07.710
That light…

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:09.520
You did this?

00:15:09.520 --> 00:15:13.470
Another human supporter has arrived.

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:15.600
Let's just lock them up.

00:15:20.130 --> 00:15:20.910
What?

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:23.300
Expect Protection!

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:30.220
Kusanagi's program worked!

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:35.710
Okay, here's your portion.

00:15:38.980 --> 00:15:42.210
All right!  Ai fly!

00:15:43.340 --> 00:15:46.060
Windy!  How dare you do that!

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:48.800
Now that he's free, he's acting tough.

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:52.770
Begin your final turn!

00:15:52.770 --> 00:15:57.530
It won't be final unless I exterminate you!

00:15:57.530 --> 00:15:59.640
My turn!  I draw!

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:05.660
Since you don’t have your ace, 
you can’t destroy Bahamut Bomber!

00:16:06.760 --> 00:16:09.390
Pretending to be confident?

00:16:09.390 --> 00:16:12.950
Since you have lame imagination, 
you can’t imagine this!

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:17.370
I activate the Field Spell, 
Boot Sector Launch!

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:20.960
I Special Summon a Rokket from my graveyard!

00:16:21.640 --> 00:16:24.470
Come, Anesthrokket Dragon!

00:16:24.470 --> 00:16:28.820
Then I summon Rokket Synchron!

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:32.680
That monster is...

00:16:33.830 --> 00:16:36.880
Rokket Synchron’s effect activates!

00:16:36.880 --> 00:16:44.080
When it's summoned, I can Special Summon a 
Level 5 or higher Dark Dragon from my graveyard...

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:47.920
...in defense position 
by negating its effects!

00:16:48.260 --> 00:16:50.930
Come, Speedburst!

00:16:50.930 --> 00:16:56.240
The Special Summoned monster is 
destroyed at the end of the turn.

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:58.470
You can’t be…

00:16:58.470 --> 00:17:00.470
I can be!

00:17:04.440 --> 00:17:15.250
Level 1 Rokket Synchron tunes Level 1 
Anesthrokket Dragon and Level 6 Speedburst Dragon!

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:21.170
Tuning…  Synchro…

00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:30.290
Heroic dragon!  Fire by transforming 
your ferocious fangs into bullets!

00:17:30.290 --> 00:17:32.160
Synchro Summon!

00:17:32.160 --> 00:17:34.900
Come out, Level 8!

00:17:38.830 --> 00:17:41.910
Borreload Savage Dragon!

00:17:44.380 --> 00:17:45.780
Synchro?

00:17:45.780 --> 00:17:47.310
Level 8!

00:17:47.310 --> 00:17:50.160
Is that Revolver’s new ace monster?

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:54.590
Borreload Savage Dragon’s effect activates!

00:17:55.020 --> 00:18:00.400
When it's Synchro Summoned, 
it treats a Link  Monster

00:18:00.400 --> 00:18:03.810
in the graveyard as an 
Equip Card and equip it.

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:08.330
And gains a Borrel Counter 
for each of its Link Markers.

00:18:08.330 --> 00:18:11.900
I equip Borreload Dragon!

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:21.750
Equip Borreload Dragon?

00:18:21.750 --> 00:18:24.490
This was unexpected.

00:18:24.490 --> 00:18:27.230
That’s why I hate humans!

00:18:27.230 --> 00:18:30.960
He keeps doing what I don't expect!

00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:35.340
Borreload Savage Dragon’s 
additional effect!

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:41.770
It gains half the equipped monster's ATK!

00:18:41.770 --> 00:18:44.770
Borreload Dragon has 3000 ATK!

00:18:48.150 --> 00:18:51.020
Too bad, but it’s over!

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:53.750
Bahamut Bomber’s effect activates!

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:59.720
I destroy a card in your Spell & 
Trap Zone, and you take 500 damage!

00:18:59.720 --> 00:19:02.370
I destroy Borreload Dragon!

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:05.960
You fool!  That’s why I said 
you have lame imagination!

00:19:08.470 --> 00:19:11.710
Borreload Savage Dragon’s effect activates!

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:18.670
When you activate an effect, I remove one 
Borrel Counter to negate that activation!

00:19:18.940 --> 00:19:20.150
What?

00:19:20.150 --> 00:19:23.280
Atone for your crimes in the afterlife!

00:19:23.940 --> 00:19:24.880
Battle!

00:19:25.830 --> 00:19:30.790
Borreload Savage Dragon 
attacks Bahamut Bomber!

00:19:47.030 --> 00:19:49.870
What a... huge comeback...

00:19:50.550 --> 00:19:53.760
Light...ning…

00:19:55.430 --> 00:19:58.050
Impressive dueling tactics.

00:19:58.050 --> 00:20:00.580
A pity that a human like you must be erased.

00:20:00.580 --> 00:20:03.710
Lightning…

00:20:03.710 --> 00:20:06.420
You underestimated him, Windy.

00:20:06.420 --> 00:20:07.920
Finish him.

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:10.670
Wait, Revolver!

00:20:20.080 --> 00:20:21.830
Windy…

00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:27.710
Lightning...

00:20:27.710 --> 00:20:28.880
Lightning!

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:42.260
You instinctively shouted 
to help your ally, Ignis.

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:44.120
I…

00:20:44.120 --> 00:20:45.050
Ai…

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:48.800
It means you’re just 
the same Ignis as them.

00:20:48.800 --> 00:20:53.770
I knew he’d erase him, but 
he did it with no hesitation.

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:57.780
Fire Ignis, I heard them call you Flame.

00:20:57.780 --> 00:21:00.170
Are you siding with the humans too?

00:21:00.170 --> 00:21:02.780
There are no sides.

00:21:02.780 --> 00:21:06.620
Flame wants to stop the fight 
between humans and Ignis!

00:21:07.040 --> 00:21:10.450
It's impossible to avoid a fight now.

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:13.320
On that point, I agree with you.

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:16.530
Wait, Lightning!

00:21:16.530 --> 00:21:20.310
Unlike Windy, you're more level-headed!

00:21:20.310 --> 00:21:24.900
Judging by what he did, I no longer am.

00:21:26.860 --> 00:21:28.380
You’re…

00:21:29.790 --> 00:21:31.850
Bohman!  Haru!

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:35.360
What did you do with Kusanagi’s brother?

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:36.320
Where is he?

00:21:36.720 --> 00:21:39.100
You mean Jin Kusanagi.

00:21:39.100 --> 00:21:43.790
He’s been in front of you from the start.

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:45.020
What?

00:21:50.500 --> 00:21:51.970
No way…

00:21:51.970 --> 00:21:54.070
Your partner is…

00:21:56.350 --> 00:21:58.400
No way…

00:22:19.870 --> 00:22:26.210
Memories that don't disappear
And memories that disappeared

00:22:26.440 --> 00:22:32.910
I quietly "NOW LOADING..." those scenes

00:22:33.340 --> 00:22:36.410
Memories left behind  Erased memories

00:22:36.410 --> 00:22:39.550
What was the PASSWORD again?

00:22:39.980 --> 00:22:44.150
ACCESS records  Restored memories

00:22:44.420 --> 00:22:47.120
Challenge "the you inside you"

00:22:51.830 --> 00:22:58.000
You're a Network  The 
World that spreads beyond

00:22:58.140 --> 00:23:01.140
With repeating "nows"

00:23:01.470 --> 00:23:05.080
What about you?  "Live for now"

00:23:05.240 --> 00:23:11.030
Grab the Shooting Star in 
the sky with both your hands

00:23:11.180 --> 00:23:14.320
Overcome "now" with all your might  Yell!

00:23:36.460 --> 00:23:39.000
Now all the participants are known.

00:23:39.000 --> 00:23:47.810
Due to Lightning's proclamation, the fight 
for humanity and AIs' existence begins.

00:23:47.810 --> 00:23:51.340
The gap between them widens.

00:23:51.340 --> 00:23:55.380
Is the path to a peaceful resolution gone?

00:23:55.380 --> 00:23:58.580
Can't this fight be avoided?

00:23:58.580 --> 00:24:02.520
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
Declaration of War

00:24:02.520 --> 00:24:04.850
Into the VRAINS!
